// Bandit Level 10 → Level 11

URL: https://overthewire.org/wargames/bandit/

Step1: Log in to the Bandit Level 10 server using SSH:

        ssh bandit10@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step2: Enter the password obtained from Bandit Level 9.

Step3: List the files in the current directory:

        ls

Step4: A file named `data.txt` is present.

Step5: The contents of the file are encoded in Base64.

Step6: Decode the contents of `data.txt` using the `base64` command:

        base64 -d data.txt

Step7: The decoded output is the password required to log in to the next level, `bandit11`.

Step8: Use the obtained password to connect to the next level:

        ssh bandit11@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step9: The Bandit Level 10 → Level 11 challenge is solved.

Step10: Congratulations!! you have solved this problem!!
